      "number_raw": "121",
      "source_number": "121",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Well, you probably passed Deputy Fry on your way down here.  His boss is Sheriff Greene, and you'll find him in the Police Station most of the time.",
      "source_text": "Well, you probably passed Deputy Fry on your way down here.  His boss is Sheriff Greene, and you'll find him in the Police Station most of the time.",
